-## 二、八大类高端提示词库
+## 一、纪念Vlog完整分镜序列（CREST六段式 · 直接调用）
 
-### A类：空镜/静物类（回忆录空镜钩子）
+### 1.1 完整版（60秒 · 6镜头 · Seedance 2.0优化版）
 
-#### A1. 空窝阳光钩子（宠物离世空镜）
+#### Shot 1 — 起·空镜钩子（0-8秒）— 类别：A类空镜
 
 ```
 Macro close-up of an empty woven pet bed by a sunlit wooden window, dust particles floating in golden sunbeams, single strand of fur remaining on cushion, soft shadow slowly drifting across fabric, time-lapse of morning light shifting to dusk, shallow depth of field f/1.8, volumetric god rays, melancholic atmosphere, faded film look, subtle grain, 8 seconds seamless.
 ```
 
-- **适用场景**：回忆录开篇、情绪铺垫、转场过渡
-- **关键技术词**：macro close-up / dust particles / volumetric god rays / time-lapse / faded film look / f/1.8
-- **效果分析**：用"空"叙事而非"在场"——空窝+单根毛发+光影流转构成强烈缺席感；体积光制造神圣氛围
-
-#### A2. 旧项圈静物
+#### Shot 2 — 承·回忆快剪（8-25秒）— 类别：C类动作+D类人物
 
 ```
-Still shot of a worn leather pet collar resting on a wooden table, soft morning side light through linen curtains, subtle dust motes, worn metal buckle reflecting warm glow, shallow focus, kodak portra 400 film look, muted warm tone, gentle handheld micro-movement, nostalgic memory tone, 6 seconds.
+@Image1 A golden retriever wagging tail vigorously at front door when owner returns, whole body wiggling with excitement, handheld joyful camera, warm entryway light, realistic fur physics, natural motion. Quick cut to: @Image1 same golden retriever lying with chin on owner's feet while owner works at desk, warm lamp light, slow push-in dolly, intimate documentary style, kodak portra 400 tone. Quick cut to: @Image1 same golden retriever eating from bowl happily, sunlight from kitchen window, warm color grade, nostalgic tone, soft film grain, synced to gentle piano melody building up, 17 seconds seamless.
 ```
 
-- **适用场景**：章节分隔、情感回闪
-- **关键技术词**：still shot / side light / kodak portra 400 / muted warm tone / handheld micro-movement
-- **效果分析**：Kodak Portra 400胶片模拟带来"私人记忆"质感；侧光凸显皮革纹理的岁月感
+#### Shot 3 — 转·离别瞬间（25-35秒）— 类别：D类人物情感
+
+```
+Close-up of owner's aged hand gently stroking empty pet cushion, slow motion 60fps, finger trembling slightly, dust particles floating in window light, single tear falling on cushion fabric, soft warm backlight, shallow focus f/1.8, intimate emotional, kodak portra 400 tone, sudden silence in audio, then single piano note, maintain character consistency, realistic skin texture and tear physics, 10 seconds.
+```
 
-#### A3. 食盆与水滴
+#### Shot 4 — 留白·静默时刻（35-40秒）— 类别：A类空镜
 
 ```
-Overhead static shot of an empty ceramic pet bowl on terracotta floor, a single water drop falling in slow motion 240fps, ripple expanding, soft window light, desaturated warm tone, minimalist composition, Wabi-sabi aesthetic, 4k cinematic, 5 seconds.
+Slow drifting shot of worn leather pet collar resting on wooden table, dust settling in a beam of afternoon light, completely still, no movement, soft morning side light through linen curtains, worn metal buckle reflecting warm glow, melancholic, contemplative, kodak portra 400 film look, muted warm tone, audio: complete silence for 2 seconds, then faint sound of wind chimes, cinematic 4K, 5 seconds.
 ```
 
-- **适用场景**：静默时刻、释怀过渡
-- **关键技术词**：overhead static shot / 240fps / desaturated / Wabi-sabi / minimalist composition
-- **效果分析**：俯拍+极简构图制造冥想感；240fps水滴慢镜+涟漪=时间凝固；侘寂美学契合怀念心境
+#### Shot 5 — 合·释怀释放（40-55秒）— 类别：C类动作+E类自然
+
+```
+@Image1 Slow motion 120fps tracking shot of the same dog running through a sunlit wildflower meadow at golden hour, ears and fur flowing in wind, tongue out joyful expression, lens flare from backlight, low angle dynamic camera following, the dog looks back once toward camera as if smiling, then continues running toward the horizon, Terrence Malick style, ethereal, hopeful, strings swelling in BGM, realistic fur and grass physics, natural motion, seamless transition from melancholic to warm tone, 15 seconds.
+```
 
-#### A4. 空荡的门口等待
+#### Shot 6 — 收·金句淡出（55-60秒）— 类别：F类转场
 
 ```
-Wide static shot of an empty hallway with a closed door, afternoon sunlight casting long shadows on wooden floor, a pet bed beside the door still positioned as if waiting, dust particles floating in light beam, complete stillness, melancholic atmosphere, Terrence Malick style, desaturated cool tone, 4k cinematic, 6 seconds.
+Slow fade to soft white, a single line of text appears gently in elegant serif font, warm piano returning, soft and resolving, peaceful closure, 4K cinematic, clean composition, 5 seconds.
