+|------|------|------|------|
+| 温馨日常 | slow push-in dolly | soft morning window light | kodak portra 400 |
+| 快乐奔跑 | low angle tracking shot | golden hour backlight | cinematic teal/orange |
+| 悲伤离别 | static shot → slow zoom out | blue hour twilight | desaturated cool tone |
+| 释怀希望 | tilt up ascending | volumetric god rays | Terrence Malick style |
+| 静物空镜 | overhead static shot | side lighting through curtain | Wabi-sabi aesthetic |
+
+### 5.3 情感强度调节器
 
 ```
-A {breed} dog tilting head with confused expression as owner speaks, ears perking up, then a happy tail wag, bright kitchen setting, natural daylight, handheld camera slight movement, playful warm tone, realistic facial expression, natural fur movement, synced to cheerful ukulele melody, 5 seconds.
+// 轻度温暖（日常回忆录用）
+warm nostalgic tone, soft focus, gentle piano, cozy atmosphere
+
+// 中度感动（年度回忆用）
+emotional but hopeful, kodak portra 400, slow push-in, strings building
+
+// 深度催泪（纪念Vlog用）
+intimate emotional, 60fps slow motion, sudden silence, tear physics, single piano note
 ```
 
